<title>SLOVAKIA: Slovak 1996 real retail sales up 6.9 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Slovak 1996 real retail sales up 6.9 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Slovak retail sales rose by 6.9 percent in real terms in 1996 compared to 1995, the Slovak Statistical Bureau (SUSR) said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>It added that the revenue from retail sales in December rose by 3.7 percent in real terms compared to the same month of 1995.</p>
<p>In 1995, Slovak real retail sales rose by 2.0 percent compared to 1994.</p>
<p>-- Bratislava Newsroom, 42-7-5218-402</p>
</text>
